OpenWrt Console
================

> 一句话：本文件是本项目的第三方组件与商标声明 —— 谁被用、用在哪、什么许可证。

This product includes software developed as part of the OpenWrt Console project.

The repository's own code is released under the MIT License; see the LICENSE
